==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
Lizalfos Talons are [[Monster Part]]s that are dropped by all types of [[Lizalfos]] and [[Stalizalfos]] upon their defeat. They can be combined with critters in a [[Cooking Pot]] to make an [[Elixir]].<ref name="BotW Inventory"/> They can also be sold to [[Kilton]] at the [[Fang and Bone]] for [[Mon]] or given to the [[Kochi Dye Shop]] to make Gray [[Dye]].

The [[Zora Set]] requires five Lizalfos Talons, as well as five [[Hyrule Bass]], to upgrade each piece to their second tiers at a [[Great Fairy Fountain]].
